SUMMARY:Sunday Sessions at Paradise Ridge Winery
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy sweeping views of rolling hills and vineyards during Sunday Sessions at Paradise Ridge Winery. Held on the 1st and 3rd Sundays from May 3 through September 20\, from 1–4 PM\, this relaxed afternoon features live acoustic music and popular tunes set against a warm\, scenic backdrop.    Guests can unwind with a selection of light fare\, including artisan cheeses\, cured meats\, olives\, hand pies\, and more. It’s an easygoing way to sip\, snack\, and soak in the beauty of wine country while enjoying great music and company.    A perfect way to spend a laid-back Sunday afternoon.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/sunday-sessions-at-paradise-ridge-winery/
LOCATION:4545 Thomas Lake Harris Drive, Santa Rosa, CA, 95403, United States
GEO:-122.7236599;38.4930065
CATEGORIES:Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Live Music,Music,Napa Valley Events,Performing Arts,Wine
