SUMMARY:Healdsburg Jazz Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Healdsburg Jazz Festival returns June 12–21\, with its most ambitious program yet. This highly anticipated event features a dynamic lineup of world-renowned musicians performing in a variety of stunning settings\, from wineries and restaurants to public plazas and historic theaters.    Blending exceptional talent with the charm of Sonoma County\, the festival offers a diverse series of must-see concerts that celebrate the spirit and creativity of jazz.      
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/healdsburg-jazz-festival/
LOCATION:783 Broadway, Sonoma, CA, 95476, United States
