SUMMARY:Father's Day with Russian River Railbikes
DESCRIPTION:Make Father’s Day unforgettable with a unique outdoor adventure aboard Russian River Railbikes in Cloverdale. Families can pedal along historic railroad tracks while taking in scenic views of Sonoma County’s vineyards\, redwoods\, and natural landscapes.    Perfect for all ages and fitness levels\, this family-friendly experience offers a fun and memorable way to spend time together. Guests can enjoy beautiful photo opportunities\, model train displays\, and the charm of exploring the countryside by railbike.    Whether Dad loves trains\, history\, nature\, or simply making memories with family\, this one-of-a-kind excursion is a great way to celebrate the holiday. Rides take place throughout Father’s Day weekend\, with departures available from 9:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m. Tickets range from $25–$45\, and seniors receive a 20% discount. Advance reservations are recommended\, as space is limited.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/fathers-day-with-russian-river-railbikes/2026-06-20/
LOCATION:425 Asti Road, , Cloverdale, CA, 95425, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Family Friendly,Historic,Holiday,Outdoors,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/06/20010847/AELMnJGZhUKXPG9SKVuGGw.large_.jpg
