SUMMARY:Summer Garden Party at Rodney Strong Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Welcome the season with a relaxing afternoon of wine\, music\, and outdoor fun on the Terrace and The Green. Perfect for all ages\, this laid-back summer celebration invites guests to gather with friends\, bring a picnic\, and enjoy live music in a beautiful outdoor setting. Browse the Bouquet Bar to create a custom floral arrangement or choose a playful design from the event’s face painter.    Each ticket includes a wine cocktail\, a charcuterie cup\, a seasonal summer dessert\, face painting\, and live music. Additional purchases\, including flower bar arrangements\, wine by the glass\, and bottle service\, will be available throughout the event. Enjoy a carefree summer day filled with great company\, delicious treats\, and warm-weather vibes.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/summer-garden-party-at-rodney-strong-vineyards/
