SUMMARY:Salsa Under the Stars / Summer Solstice at Keller Estate
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the Summer Solstice with an afternoon of music\, wine\, and Latino culture at Keller Estate. Guests can sip acclaimed Keller Estate wines and the winery’s signature Verjus Spritzer while enjoying live music and dancing with Sabor de mi Cuba surrounded by sun-soaked vineyards.    This lively gathering honors the longest day of the year with vibrant flavors\, community\, and festive Wine Country energy in a beautiful vineyard setting.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/salsa-under-the-stars-summer-solstice-at-keller-estate/
LOCATION:5875 Lakeville Highway, Petaluma, 94954, United States
